Subject: [PATCH] Preserve checked buffer cursors in defined helper calls

Expand only refused cursor call sites before native emission, retaining root,
64-bit offset, runtime length and access checks. Keep exported definitions,
reject recursive graphs and leave ordinary internal-only inlining unchanged.

